{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Keep atomic sizing non-overridable.** `value.__sizeof__()` still performs normal attribute lookup for entries such as `type` and `ModuleType`. A transform can return a class with a static `__sizeof__` or a module with an assigned hook, causing scheduling to execute or block in user code on the checkpoint thread. Dispatch directly to each exact built-in descriptor, or fail closed, and add class/module sentinel tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7s8LIN","finding_digest":"8c6c8c863cf549979485d6b7d23c25a3385b07a01938da8a8783d4f610964734","finding_id":"arf_v1_rrwizbr46vezpfef2235epbfum","finding_key":"insight/_export_scheduler.py::_retained_shallow_size::overridable-size-hook","identity_key":"insight/_export_scheduler.py::_retained_shallow_size::overridable-size-hook","line":183,"observation_digest":"6cfdbc73388294a59e724a9759725663c2e569e5b1c9d1c8edc84e580d87d5f6","observation_id":"aro_v1_nt63y4zyqkkklhtsjklvs4swmp","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-insight/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python_insight/_export_scheduler.py","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_rrwizbr46vezpfef2235epbfum","published_at":"2026-09-10T03:33:15Z","review_id":"arr_v1_aazv6mtkt4toiyvp5s2wmlz7z4","reviewed_base_sha":"630b7771cedb1cf561e6ac29d49b84b6291db6b4","reviewed_head_sha":"7b5c6a3383009fd90a86136b6e2622d45636fa24","reviewer":"codex","start_line":183,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":702},"record_id":"art_v1_pop3vac2zs4az3cyuqpan33exh","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-10T03:33:15Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
